  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"2371\">\n<li data-start=\"1811\" data-end=\"2018\">\n<p data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1852\"><strong data-start=\"1813\" data-end=\"1850\">No Deletion/Duplication Detected:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"2018\">\n<li data-start=\"1855\" data-end=\"1908\">\n<p data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1908\">No large exon-level copy number changes in LAMA2.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1911\" data-end=\"2018\">\n<p data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"2018\">Does not rule out <strong data-start=\"1931\" data-end=\"1966\">point mutations or small indels</strong> (consider full sequencing if clinically indicated).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<p data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2069\"><strong data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2067\">Pathogenic Deletion/Duplication Detected:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<li data-start=\"2072\" data-end=\"2154\">\n<p data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2154\">Supports diagnosis of <strong data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2151\">LAMA2-related Congenital Muscular Dystrophy (MDC1A)</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2157\" data-end=\"2209\">\n<p data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2209\">Genetic counseling for family testing recommended.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2211\" data-end=\"2371\">\n<p data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2260\"><strong data-start=\"2213\" data-end=\"2258\">Variants of Uncertain Significance (VUS):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2371\">\n<li data-start=\"2263\" data-end=\"2371\">\n<p data-start=\"2265\" data-end=\"2371\">Should be correlated with <strong data-start=\"2291\" data-end=\"2370\">clinical findings, CK levels, muscle biopsy (if done), and parental testing</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
